will obtain a $2\\times 1$ matrix, which will require finding $2$ entries, while\n\n- multiplying $B$ by $C$, we will obtain a $3\\times 2$ matrix, which will require finding $6$ entries.\n\nSo, we find the product $AB$ first:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}AB & =\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 4 & -2 \\\\ -3 & -4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNow, we multiply $AB$ by $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}ABC & =(AB)C \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}5 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\\cdot \\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 15 \\\\ 3 & -9\\end{bmatrix}\\end{aligned}\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186115835 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "c24ee771-dbe8-598f-84ff-60f041661edb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113948} {:answer/id #uuid "31f22e55-3257-560c-9b8b-1a370672646f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113949} {:answer/id #uuid "41fb8df9-f182-543a-ad39-bd4d9406f6c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113950} {:answer/id #uuid "4c8e5b8a-9724-51db-b122-6afd0420a1df" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113951} {:answer/id #uuid "63361cf3-7b7e-5c0a-8a4d-0ce1232f5d05" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}1 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113952}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "41fb8df9-f182-543a-ad39-bd4d9406f6c2" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186113950} :answer-field/id #uuid "9e1c3b65-2a4d-5f95-b0da-0c05529f3648" :answer-